      "schemaVersion": 1,
      "installation": "```sh\nflavor=night\ncurl -fsSL --create-dirs -o \"${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/tmux/living-code-$flavor.conf\" \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/living-code-theme/tmux/main/living-code-$flavor.conf\"\n```\n\nThen load it from `tmux.conf`:\n\n```tmux\nsource-file ~/.config/tmux/living-code-night.conf\n```\n\nIf you set `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`, use that path in the line above.",
      "configuration": "See [tmux's documentation](https://github.com/tmux/tmux) for application settings and reload behavior. The activation instructions above identify each supported flavor; keep your other application configuration.",
